# Documentation rules

Keep docs practical and aligned with Trial Project A submission requirements:

- **architecture.md** — system diagram in prose, Neon, workers, daily refresh, dedup
- **schema.md** — tables, deterministic IDs, status enum, JSONB fields
- **portal-coverage.md** — federal (SAM.gov) vs planned state portals
- **ai-usage.md** — how AI assisted build/review (honest, concise)
- **deployment.md** — env vars, run commands, production notes
- **metrics-summary.md** — scrape counts, error rates, data volume placeholders
- **demo-script.md** — step-by-step demo flow for reviewers

Update docs when behavior changes. Avoid empty placeholders; prefer short accurate sections over long boilerplate.
